  summary "☽'Saetacaeia-Viamana~, a scarred teacher in the fractured Communion, is summoned by Depth-Purveyor ☽'Cilocum to confront the Omega Obelisk M7-6HH39N, an ancient corrupting artifact rising toward the surface in the deep tunnels. Accompanied by Void-Merchant Valveus-morb~, she descends and discovers her dead teacher Umbra-Princeps Alnae~'s final lesson: the \"third path\" requires sacrificing her forbidden knowledge rather than destroying or embracing the Obelisk. By speaking the Crystalline Spiral backward and surrendering her three forbidden magics, ☽'Saetacaeia-Viamana~ seals the artifact and stops its rise, learning that knowledge freely given becomes a binding force more powerful than knowledge hoarded or wielded as power."
